@startuml 07g-mcp
' 图 07G：MCP 热挂受 epoch 约束。当前回合保持旧工具面。

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFAF7
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontColor #3E3A39
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 72
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ArrowColor #77716B
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #B8AFA6
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F7F3EC
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #77716B
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F7F3EC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B8B0A7

title 图 07G · MCP connect/disconnect：准入新 epoch，下一回合生效
caption <color:#6E6963>ADR-0026。MCP 2026-07-28 无协议会话。HTTP MCP 默认拒绝。占位符：operator / current-turn / next-turn。</color>

mainframe <b>单调性</b> · 热挂必须带着 SchemaAdmissionReceipt；当前 LLM 回合不换工具面
hide footbox

box "操作面" #F5F1EB
  actor "Operator\nCLI /mcp" as Op #FFFDFC
end box

box "治理" #EDE8F0
  control "ControlPlane\nschema admission" as CP #F8FBFB
end box

box "工具面" #E5ECEE
  control "applyMcpAttach\nepoch-bound surface" as Attach #F8FBFB
  participant "Discover cache\nlist/tools" as Cache #FFFDFC
end box

box "Agent 循环" #E5EDE5
  participant "Current turn\nold tool surface" as Cur #F9FCF8
  participant "Next turn\nnew epoch" as Next #F9FCF8
end box

== 0 · 存活 OS 允许 connect / disconnect ==

Op -> CP : /mcp connect | disconnect
activate CP #EDE8F0
CP -> CP : submit schema admission
alt HTTP MCP 且 schema 未准入
  CP --> Op : 拒绝 · deny-by-default
  note right of CP #F3E5DC
    httpAdmitted !== true
    则拒绝 http(s) command。
  end note
else 准入可提交
  CP -> CP : prepare / commit → 新 epoch
  CP --> Attach : SchemaAdmissionReceipt
end
deactivate CP

== 1 · 收据绑定当前 epoch ==

Attach -> Attach : fromBinding.epochId == currentEpoch\ntoBinding.epochId 必须前进
alt 无收据 / epoch 不前进 / 不匹配
  Attach --> Op : 拒绝 · fail-closed
else 收据有效
  Attach -> Cache : clearMcpDiscoveryCache
  Attach --> Op : McpToolSurface(epochId=to, admissionId)
end

== 2 · 当前回合不切换；下一回合用新面 ==

Cur -> Cur : 继续旧工具面
note right of Cur #F5F1EB
  回合中途改工具集会破坏准入单调性。
end note

Cur --> Next : turn 边界
Next -> Attach : 采用新 McpToolSurface
Next -> Cache : discover/list 按新 epoch

== 3 · 可再挂一轮 ==

Op -> CP : 下一轮 connect | disconnect
note over Op, Next #F7F3EC
  <b>工程边界</b>
  · 热挂不是静默改 syscall 表；必须经 control-plane epoch。
  · 当前 turn 结束后生效；多轮挂卸各发一份收据。
end note

footer <color:#6E6963>代码锚点：tools/src/mcp/mcpEpochAttach.ts · cli/src/wiring/mcpAttach.ts</color>
@enduml
